{"id":"00d14ca36dbe54df","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-logic-program-term-size.md","title":"有限项的节点数","display":"df-logic-program-term-size — 有限项的节点数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-logic-program-term-size","aliases":["72-df-logic-program-term-size"],"display":"df-logic-program-term-size — 有限项的节点数","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 unification; local finite-tree measure","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-logic-program-term-size"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-logic-program-term-size</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logic-program-term-size — 有限项的节点数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 unification; local finite-tree measure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in T^{a_F(f)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma:T\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma:T\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> 由有限项树递归引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(x):=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(c):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(f(\\vec t)):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(t_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(x):=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(c):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(f(\\vec t)):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(t_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自由构造树的根标签互异，递归分支唯一且每次只使用严格子树，故节点数存在唯一并为正自然数。常元与变量同为一个节点；参数化函数的整个树不会被误当作一个原子符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V=\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in T^{a_F(f)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma:T\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(x):=1,\\qquad\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(c):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(f(\\vec t)):=1+\\sum_{i<a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}_\\Sigma(t_i).","display":true}],"bytes":1357,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增6项：[[72-df-logic-program-term-size]] · [[72-ex-cyclic-term-equation]] · [[72-ex-mgu-not-unique-as-substitution]] · [[72-ex-sld-success-with-infinite-branch]] · [[72-lem-mgu-mutual-factorization]] · [[72-thm-finite-term-occurs-check]]"},{"id":"0c13b53e3c2977f7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ed15cbe9da0035aa"]}